       iibbvv__ooppeenn__xxrrccdd(())  returns  a  pointer to the opened XRCD, or NULL if the
       request fails.

       iibbvv__cclloossee__xxrrccdd(()) returns 0 on success, or the value of errno on failure
       (which indicates the failure reason).

